# Project Constitution

Before implementing, reviewing, or merging changes in this repository, read
and obey root [`CONSTITUTION.md`](../../CONSTITUTION.md).

## Non-negotiable reminders

- Data stays in the customer environment — no PII phone-home (Article I).
- Fail closed rather than silently expose or weaken masking (Article II).
- Never log raw PII; no secrets in git or images (Article III, VI).
- Bounded memory; respect resource-safety scripts (Article IV).
- Do not skip required CI, OpenSpec nuclear, or waive without an issue
  (Article V, IX).
- Update docs bound by `docs/registry.yaml` in the same change (Article X).

If a task conflicts with the constitution, stop and amend the constitution
via ADR (Article IX) — do not “shortcut to save time.”

Gate map: [`docs/ci-gates.md`](../../docs/ci-gates.md).
